{
  "name": "Healthcare Tools MCP - Patient Support",
  "displayName": "Healthcare Tools MCP - Patient Support",
  "description": "Healthcare Patient Support: look up patients, appointments, referrals, refills, statements, claims and telehealth links; book and reschedule visits, request refills, open billing inquiries and refund charges (gateway limit $50). No service-line finance or population analytics.",
